Package: leaflet.indoor
Title: Multi-Level Indoor Maps with 'Leaflet'
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Aurélien", "Nicosia", , "116816597+AurelienNicosiaULaval@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adds accessible floor controls and multi-level indoor vector
    layers to maps created with the 'leaflet' package. Simple features,
    GeoJSON, simple feature geometry collections, and optional 'SpatVector'
    objects can be displayed with one active floor per indoor data set. Room
    identifiers can also be associated with portable photo carousels whose
    images remain paired with plain-text captions.
